# Valley Pawn — Publication Calendar (daily / weekly / monthly)

**Created 2026-09-05** from a full audit of every scheduled task + native agent against what actually
landed in Slack (Rule 12). This is the canonical list of what we publish, where, when, and which task
owns it. `fleet/expected_outputs.json` is the machine-readable twin (the fleet-guardian verifies
against it twice a day); `monthly-publication-audit` (2nd + 4th of month) is the monthly net.

**Rule:** every publication has exactly ONE owner task, a fixed channel, a fixed cadence, and a marker
string that appears in every successful post. If it isn't in this file it isn't a publication.

**Standing decision (Joshua, 2026-09-05):** `#store-performance` carries WEEKLY cadence only — no
monthly EOM post there. Every other analytics and marketing channel gets a month-end summary.

